d": "1618431116537749", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585799753_1618431119871082_2702789032043512282_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EA3fH_3bJxMQ7kNvwGy6el1&_nc_oc=AdoduDbqrYeJHiAx-cqbzRK4PNPEnALjX2cqpF6VZ8vE8Q34w9xTGsgohqhQ8scfVQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ2-YJVWKAqgTsh-vvLsgdX9Haw8FToWqSCsH0MMCbp4Q&oe=6B071650"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car Jump VR-Ramp stunt", "keywords": ["carjumpvr", "carstunts", "rampjump", "magaramps", "carracinggames"], "long_description": "Welcome To the car jump ,i am your Car let's jump \nAre you ready to master extreme stunts? Take on the Car Jump VR-Ramp stunt game and embark on an adventure like no other. Gear up, rev your engines, and prepare for a high-flying, heart-stopping experience. The mega ramp car stunt game beckons\u2014the ramps are calling, and the stage is set for you to shine.\n\nKey Features of Mega Ramp Car Game:\n- Diverse selection of luxury racing stunt cars\n- Multiple HD graphics car racing tracks\n- Realistic and smooth controls for the mega ramp car game\n- Authentic sound effects enhancing the racing car game experience\n- Exciting car games simulator challenges with a focus on thrilling stunts\n- Perform daring stunts in the mega ramp racing game\n- Engaging and challenging levels", "short_description": "Are you ready to jump? Take on the Car jump VR-Ramp stunt and embark on an adventure like no other. Gear up, rev your engines, and prepare for a high-flying, heart-stopping experience. The mega ramp car stunt game beckons\u2014the ramps are calling, and the stage is set for you to shine."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rixxxstudio/meta-quest-privacy-policies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rexxxstudio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.